WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:02.140
- It is also craft week.

00:00:02.140 --> 00:00:03.750
And we have a crochet designer

00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:06.570
who's been crocheting since the age of 13

00:00:06.570 --> 00:00:09.600
and a business owner since the age of 15.

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:11.910
And she's joining us from Philadelphia.

00:00:11.910 --> 00:00:13.560
Hey, CBS 3, by the way.

00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:16.776
Please welcome Emani Outterbridge

00:00:16.776 --> 00:00:17.638
(audience applauding)

00:00:17.638 --> 00:00:18.471
- Hi Drew.

00:00:18.471 --> 00:00:19.707
- Hi Emani.

00:00:19.707 --> 00:00:21.124
- Hi Drew. Hi ya.

00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:23.750
- Okay, I have to tell you,

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:26.120
I am freaking out about
your business model.

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:28.030
It is the coolest thing I've ever seen.

00:00:28.030 --> 00:00:28.920
Take a look at this,

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:32.820
you created the world's
first yarn vending machine.

00:00:32.820 --> 00:00:34.890
- [Emani] Yes, I did. I did.

00:00:34.890 --> 00:00:39.890
- I mean, and now you have
multiple of them in Philadelphia.

00:00:39.980 --> 00:00:41.960
Your business is expanding.

00:00:41.960 --> 00:00:45.140
Cardi B has worn one of your designs.

00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:47.750
Emani, are you up for a challenge,

00:00:47.750 --> 00:00:49.510
to make something throughout the show

00:00:49.510 --> 00:00:53.240
and maybe create a little
piece by the time we're done?

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:54.560
Yes, Drew, please challenge me.

00:00:54.560 --> 00:00:56.280
I'm up for anything.

00:00:56.280 --> 00:00:57.113
Please challenge me.

00:00:57.113 --> 00:00:59.500
- Okay Emani, we're gonna do that.

00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:00.690
And we're gonna check in with you

00:01:00.690 --> 00:01:03.490
throughout the whole
show, and keep chatting.

00:01:03.490 --> 00:01:04.580
- All right, that's fine.

00:01:04.580 --> 00:01:07.040
- Okay, thanks Emani, so much.

00:01:07.040 --> 00:01:07.937
Thank you. Thank you. Thank you.

00:01:07.937 --> 00:01:09.960
And I wanted to check in with Emani.

00:01:09.960 --> 00:01:11.970
How's it going?

00:01:11.970 --> 00:01:14.500
- It's going fine, Drew. Almost done.

00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:16.310
- [Drew] Oh my gosh, it's beautiful.

00:01:16.310 --> 00:01:18.680
And that's my favorite color.

00:01:18.680 --> 00:01:20.400
- Yeah, they told me you love yellow.

00:01:20.400 --> 00:01:21.233
- It's true.

00:01:21.233 --> 00:01:22.550
It's our signature color of the show.

00:01:22.550 --> 00:01:24.300
What are you making?

00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:25.420
- A bikini.

00:01:25.420 --> 00:01:26.340
- [Drew] Oh, no way!

00:01:26.340 --> 00:01:27.910
- Yes.

00:01:27.910 --> 00:01:28.870
- Oh my God! All right.

00:01:28.870 --> 00:01:31.112
I'm gonna go on a diet right now.

00:01:31.112 --> 00:01:32.930
(everyone laughing)

00:01:32.930 --> 00:01:34.020
Emani, you're so amazing.

00:01:34.020 --> 00:01:36.630
I'm gonna check back in
with you and I want to know,

00:01:36.630 --> 00:01:38.310
how and why you started your business.

00:01:38.310 --> 00:01:39.800
I'll be right back with you.

00:01:39.800 --> 00:01:41.133
- Probably in the news break.
- [Emani] Okay.

00:01:41.133 --> 00:01:43.900
Thank you, Emani. You're so beautiful.

00:01:43.900 --> 00:01:47.900
Let's check in with our intrepid
crochet designer, Emani,

00:01:47.900 --> 00:01:49.490
who's been crocheting something special

00:01:49.490 --> 00:01:50.650
for us throughout the show.

00:01:50.650 --> 00:01:52.750
Emani, how's it going?

00:01:52.750 --> 00:01:54.053
- It's going, it's going.

00:01:54.920 --> 00:01:55.753
We're almost done.

00:01:55.753 --> 00:01:57.130
- [Drew] Okay, I'm so excited.

00:01:57.130 --> 00:01:58.530
I'm gonna check back in with you

00:01:58.530 --> 00:02:01.769
in the next segment and see you again.

00:02:01.769 --> 00:02:03.010
Emani, how's it going?

00:02:03.010 --> 00:02:04.160
I'm checking in with you.

00:02:04.160 --> 00:02:06.323
We're almost out of time.

00:02:06.323 --> 00:02:07.370
- We're all done.

00:02:07.370 --> 00:02:09.430
Here's the bottom, and here's the top.

00:02:09.430 --> 00:02:11.580
Oh, Emani, you are so amazing.

00:02:11.580 --> 00:02:12.960
And if you want to go to our website,

00:02:12.960 --> 00:02:14.920
we're going to feature Emani's website.

00:02:14.920 --> 00:02:16.563
'Cause you starting a business at 15,

00:02:16.563 --> 00:02:18.530
you have so much to teach people.

00:02:18.530 --> 00:02:21.310
Thank you so much for
being on the show today.

00:02:21.310 --> 00:02:25.432
And to all of our Veteran
friends and family today,

00:02:25.432 --> 00:02:29.580
honored, honored to
spend this time with you.

00:02:29.580 --> 00:02:31.520
Please take this with you for the rest

00:02:31.520 --> 00:02:34.120
of this most important Veteran's Day.

00:02:34.120 --> 00:02:35.640
We'll see you soon.

00:02:35.640 --> 00:02:38.968
Cheers.
(audience applauding)

00:02:38.968 --> 00:02:42.051
(upbeat theme music)

